  Film names (Kodak Portra 400…), brand and app names (Sony, Creators' App…) and
  camera models are proper nouns: they stay as they are in every language.
  Camera menu paths name the camera's own menus: translated only with the maker's
  official Japanese wording; each such entry says which way it went.
  Terms: phone = スマホ, hotspot = テザリング, grain = 粒子, warmth = 色温度,
  tint = 色かぶり補正, slide = リバーサル, B&W = モノクロ.
-->
